Artsy takes his position at the front of his bridge, he barely hesitates as he looks out across the gorge, then with a sudden leap he jumps over the first segement of the bridge.
Artsy: Naturally I rigged my own Segment
He continues on stepping onto the second, third, fourth and even fifth segment before pausing
Artsy: Of course I can't fully put my trust in all of you.
Saying that he leaps over the sixth segment of the bridge
